{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16975","headline":"秋日书怀 · 武元衡","name":"秋日书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金貂玉铉奉君恩，夜漏晨钟老掖垣。\n参决万机空有媿，静观羣动亦无言。\n杯中壮志红颜歇，林下秋声绦叶翻。\n倦鸟不知归去日，青芜白露满郊园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}